{"game": "arc-raiders", "language": "english", "appid": 1808500, "month": "2026-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1772323200, "end_date": 1772927999, "month_true_total": 12918, "quota": 20, "returned": 20, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 21:18:42 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "220133347", "author": {"steamid": "76561198157215018", "personaname": "Demoem", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Demoem/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11533, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 7, "playtime_at_review": 7792, "last_played": 1788944159, "avatar": "ace7280de7fc55276c8fea80f165f406cbefda3f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Addicting..", "timestamp_created": 1772927995, "timestamp_updated": 1772927995, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220132889", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126868577", "personaname": "double o herbo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198126868577/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 4356, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 349, "last_played": 1775971673, "avatar": "b4c8059ee00c342790eb1627bc11a0afd4e68570"}, "language": "english", "review": "do a lil raidin twin", "timestamp_created": 1772927576, "timestamp_updated": 1772927576, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220132764", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005052051", "personaname": "R3volution", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/abductedagain/", "num_games_owned": 229, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 26244, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 26, "playtime_at_review": 14828, "last_played": 1788907979, "avatar": "23781f2878e007999cde45156b089573df3d2746"}, "language": "english", "review": "I absolutely love Arc Raiders. I have never played a game in this type where I’ve been so actively engaged with the in game community. The lobbies are surprisingly friendly. People genuinely want to help, whether you are brand new or a day one player. It creates an atmosphere where cooperation feels natural instead of forced.\r\n\r\nAnd when things do get spicy, it becomes incredibly cinematic. Those moments where everything suddenly escalates with players, ARC machines, and chaos everywhere feel like scenes straight out of a sci-fi movie.\r\n\r\nLike any game, it has its flaws. The requesting system feels a bit weak, and I would love to see missions that feel more impactful. I want to find things topside that I actually care about. Objectives that make it feel like what we are doing truly matters to Speranza.\r\n\r\nIt would also be great to see more world building through factions or raiders from other cities. If we are out there gathering resources and fighting ARC machines, I want it to feel like that effort changes something. I want it to feel like our runs actually move the needle for the world.\r\n\r\nThat said, the game is still less than six months from release, and if this is the foundation they are building on, I am incredibly excited to see where it goes. The core gameplay, the tension, and especially the community already make it something special.", "timestamp_created": 1772927470, "timestamp_updated": 1772927470, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220132552", "author": {"steamid": "76561198734374976", "personaname": "J4I0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/JFourI0/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 312, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 219, "last_played": 1773003448, "avatar": "73a74c7c61f19f3016cc18bd22ef8a4de948992e"}, "language": "english", "review": "one of the best games ive played in a very long time would recommend if ur trying to find something to play", "timestamp_created": 1772927287, "timestamp_updated": 1772927287, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220132426", "author": {"steamid": "76561198965615540", "personaname": "Crilex", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198965615540/", "num_games_owned": 36, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3961, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 27, "playtime_at_review": 3479, "last_played": 1788269359, "avatar": "b7fbf78e6d2abb73de19ff818cf221d1264cca7f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome Game", "timestamp_created": 1772927173, "timestamp_updated": 1772927173, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220132269", "author": {"steamid": "76561198812722718", "personaname": "AjejeBrazorf9210", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/7656119