0, "playtime_forever": 8520, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2652, "last_played": 1777383646, "avatar": "cee7b44e87df573d08d6792e2eb865ff0498dc6a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game, everything from the graphics to the quests are absolutely great, I have been waiting a long time for a game of such quality and for the price it is crazy, WORTH EVERY PENNY.\n\n10/10", "timestamp_created": 1772926639, "timestamp_updated": 1772926639, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220131803", "author": {"steamid": "76561198302077208", "personaname": "Zerx", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/NatsuV21/", "num_games_owned": 774, "num_reviews": 127, "playtime_forever": 1120, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 446, "last_played": 1775932920, "avatar": "f43c3430f476b89c1ee1d56ab4cf2aef16290d80"}, "language": "english", "review": "Arc Raiders can be described simply as a 55+ Extraction shooter community. \n\nIt's for people who aren't good at fast paced gameplay and just want a relaxing time walking around. Which by itself isn't a bad thing, just not for me. I could fall asleep walking across the map.\n\nMay update after more gameplay but right now I'd say the game is kinda boring? You don't do much, you just wander looking for loot. Also not a big fan of how the bots are everywhere. That's kinda stupid, they should be protecting POI's. Also almost 70% of the time you spawn in a late raid. Who's dumbass choice was that? All loot is already gone. They can't even afford new servers. Actually crazy. They 100% take the money and run. Game is dead in a year.\n\nI don't understand how it's so popular honestly but I think it's just not for me.\n\nAnd also stop being such cheap losers, pay some voice actors you lazy pricks.\n\nGame is sponsored by Israel and loved by people who love Epstien and diddling kids", "timestamp_created": 1772926623, "timestamp_updated": 1773561075, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.557902276515960693", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "hardware": {"system_ram": "65397", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-10850K CPU @ 3.60GHz", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080", "vram_size": 10053}, "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 27, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 31, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "220131741", "author": {"steamid": "76561198762324101", "personaname": "GroovyPython", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198762324101/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 4442, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2461, "last_played": 1779049397, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "I would recommend Arc Raiders for anyone that wants a rewarding experience, and in my opinion it is the most complete and engaging extraction shooter experience. 10/10 generational game reminds me of how fun prime fortnite was", "timestamp_created": 1772926578, "timestamp_updated": 1772926578, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220131557", "author": {"steamid": "76561199865034277", "personaname": "veryklever", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "ht