t other players (even if they shoot or kill you). The game will move you to pvp matches if you shoot other players and will put you into carebear matches (non hostile player matches) if you refrain from looting and attacking other players. It doesnt reward defending yourself, it just simply sees you are or arent engaged in pvp and moves you accordingly.\n\nquick tip\nIf game starts feeling boring, start engaging in pvp. Way more fun that way.", "timestamp_created": 1772926263, "timestamp_updated": 1772926263, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220131364", "author": {"steamid": "76561198881895844", "personaname": "UniX_3", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198881895844/", "num_games_owned": 39, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 10886, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10711, "last_played": 1776567283, "avatar": "22a5d75948a6adfd18ce62f5a272872b97694076"}, "language": "english", "review": "Despite the AI issues, the game received praise for its strong, cooperative gameplay, \"unusually friendly community,\" and polished feel.", "timestamp_created": 1772926219, "timestamp_updated": 1772926219, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220131270", "author": {"steamid": "76561198896987415", "personaname": "Dunkey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198896987415/", "num_games_owned": 40, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 2897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2523, "last_played": 1777525601, "avatar": "5198708b1b88da66505f606723bc598ae2aba3e1"}, "language": "english", "review": "i ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ love this game, great for casual PvE or high stakes PvP! If you're stuck in lobbies that dont fit your playstyle, just rate the match poorly, and the game will change who you play against using its aggression based matchmaking.", "timestamp_created": 1772926140, "timestamp_updated": 1775334094, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220130840", "author": {"steamid": "76561198780098451", "personaname": "korny", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198780098451/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 26669, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1305, "playtime_at_review": 12348, "last_played": 1789074409, "avatar": "a80a48024f202fbf06b65c6f4260d9b70d6fc251"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best game!", "timestamp_created": 1772925750, "timestamp_updated": 1772925750, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220130836", "author": {"steamid": "76561199277188544", "personaname": "Pikla ⏾", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lucylious/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 59639, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2563, "playtime_at_review": 24734, "last_played": 1788559555, "avatar": "6a1bb05822eb5654a5faaa607abdcc2e6ec4fe73"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love it. The excitement, the frustration, the madness, the interactions with people! Just love it xD", "timestamp_created": 1772925746, "timestamp_updated": 1772925746, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220130792", "author": {"steamid": "76561198346818865", "personaname": "Mein Clouds", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198346818865/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 13825, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13775, "last_played": 1772994959, "avatar": "266ddd0554aedc1a5bfaed6f372b94e8c63064a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yep", "timestamp_created": 1772925718, "timestamp_updated": 1772925718, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220130759", "author": {"steamid": "76561198964535205", "personaname": "the_coziest", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198964535205/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 12, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12, "last_played": 1772855692, "avatar": "9b099aac77ecbcd1b1b9c2bf9552899aa0ce6383"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bro, do NOT charge me $40 for a game and then prevent me from actually playing it unless I sign up for some ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ account with the company. That's an immediate refund, thank you so much.\n\nI will not eat the bugs. I will not live in the pod. And I will not give money to grubby little tech bros who want to turn every human being into marketing fodder.", "timestamp_created": 1772925691, "timestamp_updated": 1772925691, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220130730", "author": {"steamid": "76561198329847496", "personaname": "Be_my_13th_reason", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/spartan1996/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 10462, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9728, "last_played": 1783609032, "avatar": "77c4e42d0647ed05ceb5fea953eabb042d41b043"}, "language": "english", "review": "The instability for PCs from a previous update was patched. Overall, a pretty good game. \nPlayer interactions keep it interesting, but the Trial rewards are kinda mid. The game could benefit from an increased Projects system, but there is a big release coming at the end of the month, which should make the game more interesting. ", "timestamp_created": 1772925664, "timestamp_updated": 1774388933, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}]}